"╭────────────────── Monday, October 5 2026 (today) ──────────────────╮"
"│1.╭ Options ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮  │"
"│  │     Once a day, when todoro opens, see if there's a newer    │  │"
"│  │     version and say so in the status bar. It never installs  │  │"
"│  │     one: :update does, when you choose.                      │  │"
"│  │                                                              │  │"
"│  │ Notes                                                        │  │"
"│  │ [ ] Empty notes in normal                                    │  │"
"│  │     Empty notes open ready to type. With this on, they open  │  │"
"│  │     in normal mode, and i starts typing.                     │  │"
"│  │ [ ] Notes with text in insert                                │  │"
"│  │     Notes with text open in normal mode. With this on, they  │  │"
"│  │     open ready to type at the end.                           │  │"
"│  │ Notes editor: nvim                                           │  │"
"│  │   A command to open notes files with, like nvim. Leave it    │  │"
"│  │   empty for todoro's own editor.                             │  │"
"╰──╰─────── j/k move · space toggle · / search · esc close ───────╯──╯"
" OPTIONS   j/k move  space toggle  / search  esc close                "
